UPDATE companies SET description='OceanHead Solar & Electric operates from Honolulu on the island of Oahu, Hawaii. It is certified as a Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB) and a Disadvantaged Business Enterprise (DBE), and holds an A+ rating from the Better Business Bureau.

The firm designs and installs solar photovoltaic systems, battery backup, and electric vehicle charging infrastructure for residential and commercial clients. Its in-house licensed team manages projects from initial design through permitting and final installation, handling work that ranges from single-home rooftops to multi-building government contracts. The company also repairs orphaned systems left by other installers and performs electrical infrastructure upgrades, including multi-meter buildings and higher-voltage requirements.

OceanHead serves homeowners, commercial property owners, general contractors, manufacturers, and government agencies across Oahu. Commercial projects include flat-roof and carport-mounted solar arrays, fleet EV charging deployments, and full electrical system rebuilds. The company acts as a WOSB/DBE subcontractor on large-scale government solar and electrical work, and partners with contractors needing technical depth for complex installations.

The company emphasizes its local expertise with Hawaii''s salt-air and high-UV conditions, designing each system around the specific roof type and structural capacity. It offers an Energy Service Agreement that covers the upfront cost of all services, and manages Hawaiian Electric net-energy-metering applications as part of every commercial installation. The founders state their mission is to make solar and battery storage attainable and long-lasting with no barriers to commitment.', certifications=ARRAY['Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB)','Disadvantaged Business Enterprise (DBE)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar photovoltaic system design and installation", "EV charging station installation (residential and commercial)", "Battery backup system installation", "Electrical contractor services (LIC# C-33164)", "Electrical infrastructure upgrades", "Orphaned solar system repair and maintenance", "Commercial roof solar mounting design (flat roof, carport, ground-mount)", "Net energy metering application management", "Multi-meter building electrical work", "High-voltage electrical installations", "Energy Service Agreement financing"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Government", "General contractors", "Manufacturers", "Renewable energy", "EV charging infrastructure"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed in-house team handles projects start to finish", "Certified Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB) and Disadvantaged Business Enterprise (DBE)", "Expertise in Hawaii''s salt-air and high-UV exposure conditions", "Handles complex projects: multi-meter buildings, orphaned systems, higher-voltage requirements", "Energy Service Agreement covers upfront cost of all services"], "facts_used": ["Location: Honolulu, Hawaii (Oahu) -> /", "Licensed Hawaii solar and electrical contractor LIC# C-33164 -> /", "Certified Women-Owned Small Business (WOSB) and Disadvantaged Business Enterprise (DBE) -> /, db", "Founders/owners: Gail and Chelli -> /", "A+ Better Business Bureau rating -> /", "Services: solar PV, battery backup, EV charging installation, electrical upgrades, orphaned system repair -> /", "In-house team handles design through installation -> /", "Serves residential, commercial, contractors, manufacturers, government -> /", "Commercial expertise: flat roofs, carports, ground-mount, multi-meter buildings, high-voltage -> /", "Energy Service Agreement covers upfront costs -> /", "Manages Hawaiian Electric NEM/self-supply applications -> /", "Mission: make solar and battery storage attainable and long-lasting -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "OceanHead Solar and Electric is a licensed Hawaii solar and electrical contractor (LIC# C-33164) ... design and install solar, battery backup, and EV charging across Oahu, with the licensed depth to handle unique, complex projects most companies can''t take on, all of it in-house, start to finish.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Small business"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='oceanhead-solar-electric' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Oceanside Welding & Fabrication operates from Oakland Park, Florida, serving Broward and Palm Beach counties. The company was founded by Jerry Menagh, who built the business on years of hands-on welding and aluminum fabrication experience. What began as a small local operation has grown into a family-owned shop known for structural aluminum work across South Florida.

The shop specializes in custom aluminum railings, gates, and fencing for residential and commercial properties, along with lanai column repair, trailer fabrication, and general metal fabrication in aluminum, stainless steel, and mild steel. Work is performed both in-house at their 4340 NE 5th Terrace facility and via mobile welding units. CNC plasma cutting capability is slated to come online soon. Projects run from design through cutting, welding, and installation, with powder coating coordinated as needed.

Customers include homeowners, builders, and property managers throughout South Florida. The company also builds custom trailers for pressure-washing, landscaping, and recreational use. Marine repairs such as pontoon welding have been performed, though the core focus remains architectural and structural aluminum for coastal environments.

Menagh started the business on the principle of doing the job right with pride. The company emphasizes clean welds, corrosion-resistant materials, transparent quoting, and dependable timelines. Its stated values—craftsmanship, integrity, reliability, safety, and community—guide a model that combines in-shop precision with on-site mobility.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom aluminum fabrication", "Aluminum railing fabrication and installation", "Aluminum gate fabrication and installation", "Aluminum fencing fabrication and installation", "Lanai column repair and welding", "Custom metal fabrication (aluminum, stainless steel, mild steel)", "Trailer repair and fabrication", "CNC plasma cutting (planned)", "Mobile welding", "In-shop fabrication", "Powder coating coordination", "Dumpster and utility gate fabrication", "Mailbox and signage fabrication", "Bracket, beam, and metal frame fabrication", "Decorative metal piece fabrication", "Patio post repair", "Pool enclosure support repair", "Driveway and entry gate fabrication", "Balcony and pool railing fabrication", "Decorative and privacy fencing fabrication", "Commercial handrail and barrier fabrication", "Pressure washing trailer fabrication", "Landscape trailer fabrication", "Flat bed trailer fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Property Management", "Construction", "Landscaping", "Marine"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Mild steel"], "equipment": ["CNC plasma cutter (planned)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile and in-shop service options", "Transparent quotes and dependable timelines", "Locally owned and insured family business", "Specialists in custom aluminum railings, gates, fencing, and structural aluminum fabrication", "4.9-star Google rating with 230+ reviews"], "facts_used": ["Company name and location -> db", "Owner Jerry Menagh -> /about", "Family-owned business -> /about and /", "Services: custom aluminum railings, gates, fencing, lanai column repair, custom metal fabrication, trailer repair, CNC plasma cutting (coming soon) -> /, /services, /about", "Mobile and in-shop service -> / and /about", "Facility address: 4340 NE 5th Terrace, Oakland Park, FL -> /about", "Serves Broward and Palm Beach Counties -> / and /about", "4.9-star Google rating with 230+ reviews -> / and /about", "Materials: aluminum, stainless steel, mild steel -> /services and /about", "Values: craftsmanship, integrity, reliability, safety, community -> /about", "Mission: combine technical skill, integrity, innovation -> /about", "Founded on belief: do the job right and do it with pride -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in custom aluminum railings, gates, and fencing for residential and commercial properties across South Florida. Every project is fabricated in-house, professionally installed, and built to withstand Florida''s coastal climate.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='oceanside-welding-fabrication' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Off The Line Performance operates from Des Moines, Iowa, serving automotive enthusiasts through an e-commerce platform and installation shop. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year or ownership structure; the website references Kevin Vo''s decade-long journey in the automotive space as background for the related Driven.Media brand.

The business stocks and sells aftermarket performance parts for Toyota GR Corolla (2022–2024), Toyota GR86 (2022–2024), MKV GR Supra, and Subaru WRX/STI models. Its own OTL Performance line includes billet aluminum pitch-stop mounts, catback exhaust tips, and ignition-system combos described as CNC‑machined from 6061‑T6 aluminum. It also carries third‑party brands such as K&N, H&R, and Racer X Fabrication. In addition to parts retail, the company offers custom ECU tuning and expert installation services performed by technicians who specialize in Toyota and Subaru platforms.

The product range addresses intake, exhaust, suspension, drivetrain, and ignition upgrades, with concrete examples including a K&N Typhoon intake for the GR Corolla, H&R sport springs for the GR Corolla, and Racer X engine pitch mounts.

