UPDATE companies SET description='Okaw Valley Woodworking is based in Arcola, Illinois, and has operated as a limited liability company since its founding in 2001. The business was established to produce high-end, custom-made cabinetry for residential kitchens and bathrooms, along with custom millwork services for the surrounding area.

