UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Hanover, Maryland, with a second facility in Michigan, Onsite Wire & Cable + Telinks has served as a distributor of low-voltage cabling products for more than two decades. The company operates across the Midwest and East Coast, positioning inventory to support both regional and national demand.

The firm stocks a broad range of low-voltage cable categories, including sound and security, fire alarm, coaxial, voice and data with racks and connectivity, fiber optic, and temperature control products. Beyond distribution, it provides job kitting, custom cable design, cutting and striping, and local as well as nationwide delivery.

Its customer base spans telecommunications infrastructure, central offices, cell sites, data centers, outside plant installations, and military aerospace applications. Buyers typically include engineering firms, installers, and maintenance contractors responsible for the nation’s backbone communications networks.

