UPDATE companies SET description='Orbitel Communications operates from Sun Lakes, Arizona, providing telecommunications services across the region. The company maintains local service centers in Sun Lakes, Maricopa, and SaddleBrooke, offering customers in-person support alongside 24/7 phone assistance.

