UPDATE companies SET description='Origin Food Group traces its roots to South America, where a family-owned company spent nearly four decades pioneering functional foods—introducing Swiss-style drinkable and spoonable yogurts, fortifying every product with vitamins and minerals, and using premium ingredients such as HOWARU® probiotics and TruCal® calcium. The business expanded to North America in 2009, establishing its U.S. headquarters and production facility in Statesville, North Carolina.

