UPDATE companies SET description='Located in West Springfield, Massachusetts, Osgood Textile Company has served fabric enthusiasts for over six decades. The business operates from a single location on Park Street, offering a brick-and-mortar store alongside an e-commerce presence through OnlineFabricStore.com. Ownership details and founding year are not publicly disclosed.

