UPDATE companies SET description='OTCO, Inc. was founded in 1988 in Fond du Lac, Wisconsin, as a fourth‑generation family‑owned industrial contract sewing manufacturer. The company began with a focus on custom textile fabrication and has remained under family ownership for nearly four decades.

