UPDATE companies SET description='Otter Tail Power Company is headquartered in Devils Lake, North Dakota. For nearly 120 years, the utility has generated, transmitted, and delivered electricity across a service territory that spans Minnesota, South Dakota, and North Dakota. The company''s origins trace back to the early 20th century, though a precise founding year is not publicly stated. Ownership structure is not disclosed in available materials.

The company operates as an integrated electric utility, managing generation, transmission, and distribution assets to serve residential, agricultural, commercial, and institutional customers. Its service portfolio includes electricity delivery, outage response, energy efficiency rebate programs, and customer self-service tools for account management. The utility serves homes, farms, schools, hospitals, and businesses across its three-state region.

