UPDATE companies SET description='Our World Energy, LLC is headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona. The company was founded in 2016 by Caleb Antonucci, who initially created the business as a bridge connecting solar professionals with homeowners seeking affordable energy independence. Today, the firm operates as a direct installer of solar energy systems.

