UPDATE companies SET description='PPSI has been assembling electronics in Houston, Texas, since 1986. The company remains privately held and headquartered in Houston, where it grew from a small PCB assembly shop into an AS9100D-certified manufacturing partner.

Today PPSI provides end-to-end electronics manufacturing services under one roof: surface-mount and through-hole PCB assembly with placement down to 01005 packages, custom cable and harness assemblies built to IPC/WHMA-A-620 standards, comprehensive testing including AOI, X-ray, flying probe, functional test and device programming, full box-build and electromechanical integration with conformal coating for harsh environments, and turnkey supply-chain management. The facility supports programs from new-product introduction through recurring production volumes, staffed by IPC-610-trained technicians operating within an AS9100D quality system.

The company serves military and aerospace, space and satellite, industrial, and energy and oil-and-gas customers. Its assemblies fly on defense and aerospace platforms, operate in downhole and pipeline equipment, and control complex industrial systems. PPSI’s high-reliability documentation control and process rigor are tailored for flight hardware and ground-support electronics that must not fail.

PPSI emphasizes stability from four decades in business, direct communication with the people building the product, flexibility in a high-mix environment, and the convenience of a Houston-based, U.S. manufacturing location that supports site visits and audits. The founding principle — build it right, deliver on time — still guides every order.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100D','ITAR','IPC-A-610','IPC Class 3','IPC/WHMA-A-620']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (SMT & through-hole)", "Quick-turn PCB assembly", "Component placement down to 01005", "Cable & Harness Assembly (IPC/WHMA-A-620)", "Box Build & Electromechanical Assembly", "Conformal Coating (for harsh environments)", "AOI Inspection", "X-ray Inspection", "Flying Probe Testing", "Functional Testing", "Device Programming", "Supply Chain Management (turnkey procurement, inventory management, fulfillment)", "High-Reliability Documentation Control (for flight hardware)", "NPI Support", "Production Volume Manufacturing", "Mixed-Technology PCB Assembly", "Through-hole and Connector Assembly", "Odd-form Component Placement", "Solder Paste Inspection (SPI)", "Post-Reflow Inspection"], "industries": ["Military & Aerospace", "Space & Satellite", "Industrial", "Energy & Oil and Gas"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["AOI equipment", "X-ray inspection system", "Flying probe tester", "Solder paste inspection (SPI) system", "Conformal coating equipment"], "volume": "NPI to production volumes", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Four decades in business, still privately held and Houston-based", "AS9100D-certified quality system with IPC-610-trained technicians and inspection at every stage", "Direct access to the manufacturing team \u2014 no ticket queues or runaround", "High-mix flexibility for diverse product lines and evolving requirements", "Single-source manufacturing: PCB assembly, cable/harness, test, integration, and supply chain under one quality system"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> /, /about", "Headquarters Houston, Texas -> /, /about", "Privately held -> /about", "AS9100D certified -> /, /about", "ITAR registered -> /, /about", "IPC-610 trained technicians -> /", "40+ years in business -> /, /about", "Services: PCB assembly, cable/harness, testing, systems integration, supply chain -> /services", "Industries: Military & Aerospace, Space & Satellite, Industrial, Energy & Oil and Gas -> /, /about", "Capabilities: placement down to 01005, conformal coating, high-reliability documentation -> /, /services", "Certifications: RoHS, IPC Class 3, IPC/WHMA-A-620 -> /, /about, /services", "Equipment: AOI, X-ray, flying probe, SPI, conformal coating -> /services", "Volume: NPI support through production volumes -> /services", "Differentiators: stability, quality, communication, flexibility, location -> /about", "Company type: electronics manufacturing/assembly -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "PPSI has been assembling electronics in Houston since 1986", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered"], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ppsi' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
