UPDATE companies SET description='PVD Design Company operates from Providence, Rhode Island, just south of downtown off the Thurbers Avenue curve. The business traces its roots to CJM Designs, originally founded in Rhode Island, and has been supplying custom apparel, print, and promotional products across the United States for more than 25 years.

