UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Geismar, Louisiana, Pacific Gulf Wire Rope, Inc. has operated in the wire rope and rigging industry for more than three decades. The company states it has been a leader in the field for over 34 years, building its reputation on long-term customer relationships and a focus on safety, service, and cost efficiency.

