UPDATE companies SET description='Paradise Energy Solutions operates from two Maryland branch offices in Hagerstown and Salisbury, where it serves as a family-owned, full-service solar energy company. The business lists Jason Beiler as a solar consultant and owner among a staff that includes project managers, foremen, electricians, and dedicated service technicians.

