UPDATE companies SET description='Paramont EO operates from Woodridge, Illinois, where it runs a 180,000-square-foot warehouse serving the Chicagoland area. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it describes its team as an extended family of electrical supply experts.

