UPDATE companies SET description='Paricon Technologies Corporation is based in Taunton, Massachusetts. The company operates as a designer, manufacturer, and marketer of elastomeric interconnect solutions for the electronics market.

The company develops proprietary technologies including PariPoser®, an anisotropic elastomer fabric that provides interconnects with bandwidth above 110 GHz, and PariProbe®, which combines elastomers with short solid pins for BGA probing applications. Its product line encompasses die-cut materials, adjustable swivel-top sockets, clamshell sockets, compact manual-loading sockets, double-latch sockets, flex-to-board socket assemblies, and board-to-board connectors. Paricon also offers thermal management options such as Peltier or liquid cooling for high-density BGA probing.

Paricon serves industries including test and measurement, microwave and RF, wafer testing, and custom connector applications. Its solutions target high-speed digital, waveguide, and RF applications where traditional interconnects face limitations.

The company emphasizes continuous investment in proprietary technologies and R&D to stay ahead of industry needs, with a mission to deliver innovative elastomeric interconnect solutions that enable customers to push the boundaries of electronics design and manufacturing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design of elastomeric interconnect solutions", "Manufacturing of anisotropic elastomer fabric (PariPoser\u00ae)", "Probe solutions combining elastomers and solid pins (PariProbe\u00ae)", "Die cutting of elastomeric materials", "Socket assembly (adjustable swivel-top, clamshell, compact manual-loading, double-latch, flex-to-board, board-to-board)", "Thermal management integration (Peltier, liquid cooling)", "Custom connector development for test, microwave, wafer testing"], "industries": ["Test and measurement", "Microwave and RF", "Wafer testing", "Custom connector applications", "Electronics"], "materials": ["Anisotropic elastomer fabric (PariPoser\u00ae)", "Elastomer", "Short solid pins"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["PariPoser\u00ae anisotropic elastomer fabric with bandwidth above 110 GHz", "PariProbe\u00ae technology combining elastomers and short solid pins for BGA applications", "Thermal management options including Peltier and liquid cooling for high-density probing", "Electrical path shorter than a transmission line below 100 GHz, with less than 0.1 nH inductance", "Custom connector applications for test, microwave, and wafer testing"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Taunton, Massachusetts -> db", "Designer, manufacturer, and marketer of elastomeric interconnect solutions -> /about-us", "PariPoser\u00ae anisotropic elastomer fabric with bandwidth above 110 GHz -> /about-us", "PariProbe\u00ae technology combining elastomers and short solid pins for BGA applications -> /about-us", "Thermal management options including Peltier and liquid cooling -> /about-us", "Product line include